      <div class="view-content">
          <div class="publications-item"><div class="publication-image"><a href='/publications/procurement-guidelines-for-the-cybersecurity-of-hospitals-and-healthcare-providers' title='Access to Procurement guidelines for the cybersecurity of hospitals and healthcare providers'>  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/thumbail_publications_list_98_147/public/2026-07/Screenshot%202026-07-22%20121207.png?itok=aS_Tcu1Q" width="98" height="147" alt="Cover of the ENISA publication &quot;Procurement guidelines for the cybersecurity of hospitals healthcare providers&quot; published in July 2026" class="img-fluid image-style-thumbail-publications-list-98-147" />


</a></div>
<div class="publication-content">
	<h3><a href='/publications/procurement-guidelines-for-the-cybersecurity-of-hospitals-and-healthcare-providers' title='Access to the content '>Procurement guidelines for the cybersecurity of hospitals and healthcare providers</a></h3>
	<p class="metadata">
		<span class="date"><time datetime="2026-07-22T15:21:41+03:00" title="22 July 2026 - 15:21" class="datetime">22 Jul 2026</time>
</span>
	</p>
	<div class="content"><p>The procurement guidelines presented in this document are intended to help hospitals and healthcare providers&nbsp;integrate cybersecurity objectives into their procurement processes.</p></div>
	<div class="related-topics">
		
	</div>
</div></div>
    <div class="publications-item"><div class="publication-image"><a href='/publications/cyber-hygiene-in-the-health-sector' title='Access to Cyber Hygiene in the Health Sector'>  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/thumbail_publications_list_98_147/public/2025-09/Screenshot%202025-09-16%20113250.png?itok=zbNpSvtR" width="98" height="147" alt="Cyber hygiene in the health sector illustration with medical staff, hospital, and cybersecurity icons, by ENISA" class="img-fluid image-style-thumbail-publications-list-98-147" />


</a></div>
<div class="publication-content">
	<h3><a href='/publications/cyber-hygiene-in-the-health-sector' title='Access to the content '>Cyber Hygiene in the Health Sector</a></h3>
	<p class="metadata">
		<span class="date"><time datetime="2025-09-16T11:37:50+03:00" title="16 September 2025 - 11:37" class="datetime">16 Sep 2025</time>
</span>
	</p>
	<div class="content"><p>This booklet, developed by ENISA, provides clear and targeted guidance with practical steps that health entities can take to:<br>- &nbsp;Safeguard sensitive data<br>- Minimise exposure to common cyber threats-</p></div>
	<div class="related-topics">
		
	</div>
</div></div>
    <div class="publications-item"><div class="publication-image"><a href='/publications/cybersecurity-roles-and-skills-for-nis2-essential-and-important-entities' title='Access to Cybersecurity roles and skills for NIS2 Essential and Important Entities'>  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/thumbail_publications_list_98_147/public/2025-06/Screenshot%202025-06-25%20192713.png?itok=M1rYc_cW" width="98" height="147" alt="Cover page of an ENISA report titled &#039;Cybersecurity Roles and Skills for NIS2 Essential and Important Entities&#039;, featuring a person typing on a laptop with floating digital icons representing cybersecurity roles. The report is dated June 2025 and maps NIS2 obligations to the ECSF." class="img-fluid image-style-thumbail-publications-list-98-147" />


</a></div>
<div class="publication-content">
	<h3><a href='/publications/cybersecurity-roles-and-skills-for-nis2-essential-and-important-entities' title='Access to the content '>Cybersecurity roles and skills for NIS2 Essential and Important Entities</a></h3>
	<p class="metadata">
		<span class="date"><time datetime="2025-06-26T13:00:32+03:00" title="26 June 2025 - 13:00" class="datetime">26 Jun 2025</time>
</span>
	</p>
	<div class="content"><p>&nbsp;ENISA in line with articles 6 and 10 of the Cybersecurity Act , prepared this guidance document on the skills and roles for the cybersecurity professionals needed to meet these legal requirements effectively.</p></div>
	<div class="related-topics">
		
	</div>
</div></div>
    <div class="publications-item"><div class="publication-image"><a href='/publications/handbook-for-cyber-stress-tests' title='Access to Handbook for Cyber Stress Tests'>  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/thumbail_publications_list_98_147/public/2025-05/Screenshot%202025-05-15%20122329.png?itok=XjANfusB" width="98" height="147" alt="Publication cover for Handbook for Cyber Stress Tests - Skyline image with different metrics visual" class="img-fluid image-style-thumbail-publications-list-98-147" />


</a></div>
<div class="publication-content">
	<h3><a href='/publications/handbook-for-cyber-stress-tests' title='Access to the content '>Handbook for Cyber Stress Tests</a></h3>
	<p class="metadata">
		<span class="date"><time datetime="2025-05-15T13:02:09+03:00" title="15 May 2025 - 13:02" class="datetime">15 May 2025</time>
</span>
	</p>
	<div class="content"><p>ENISA developed this handbook as guidance for national or sectorial authorities overseeing cybersecurity and resilience of critical sectors, at the national level, regional or EU level under NIS 2 Directive.</p></div>
	<div class="related-topics">
		
	</div>
</div></div>

